I built Toffu after getting frustrated juggling 20+ marketing tools.<p>Instead of logging into Google Ads, opening GA4, checking Meta dashboards, and writing reports, you just chat:<p>&quot;What&#x27;s my ROAS this week?&quot;  
&quot;Pause underperforming ads&quot;    
&quot;Create a competitor analysis&quot;  
&quot;Increase budget on winning campaigns&quot;<p>The AI executes everything – not just recommendations.<p>Connects to: Google Ads, GA4, Meta Ads, LinkedIn, Reddit, Search Console, Webflow, HubSpot, and more.<p>SOC2 certified for enterprise use.<p>Free tier available. Happy to answer questions or hear feedback.
